823	### 1. HTML Structure
824	Link your input to its error message by setting the input's `data-error` attribute to the error message's `id`. The script in section 3 lists that `id` in `aria-describedby` only while the field is invalid. Don't reference the error from `aria-describedby` in the markup: the error element is always in the page, and text that `aria-describedby` references is announced even when it's hidden, so the error would be read out before the user has interacted.
